  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4a4401fb-62a8-4314-b757-b6675fd71c39"],
 ". The walks can be vertex lists or walk graphs; a list of chains of walk \
graphs is mapped over."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"6a85b76a-ab33-4412-8ffc-85277c8b7be1"]
